<!--
  Generated from urdf/ackermann_robot.urdf via `ign sdf -p`, then edited.
  Regenerate with that command if the URDF changes; the three edits are:
    1. Gazebo Classic <script>Gazebo/Blue</script> material blocks removed.
    2. Converter float noise collapsed.
    3. AckermannSteering system added (see the comment near the bottom).

  Link layout note: every fixed-joint child (base_link, imu_link, cam_link1,
  cam_link2, cam0, cam0_undis, cam0_depth) is lumped into base_footprint by the
  URDF converter, which is exactly what Gazebo does when spawning the URDF
  directly. Their frames survive as <frame> elements at the end of the file.
-->
